"""The canonical fixture reads back exactly as built (plan D2, T1.6). Needs Docker.

Named `test_05_` rather than the plan's `test_00_fixture.py` because `test_00_*` means
Docker-free in this suite, and this one imports through the shipped container on purpose: it
is the product's own import path, so a fixture that only a hand-written REST call can load
would be a fixture the suite cannot actually use.

The size is load-bearing. `count_people`/`count_families`/`count_sources` in the product are
`len(unpaginated list)` and the server's default pagesize is 20 — at 20 objects or fewer the
pagination assumption is simply untested, which is the vacuity class this suite exists to kill.
"""

